{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14978","headline":"秋夜宴集陈翃郎中圃亭美校书郎张正元归乡 · 卢纶","name":"秋夜宴集陈翃郎中圃亭美校书郎张正元归乡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泉清兰菊稠，红果落城沟。\n保庆台榭古，感时琴瑟秋。\n硕儒欢颇至，名士礼能周。\n爲谢邑中少，无惊池上鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}